WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.1 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
From work to structure

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Structure follows the work: list the functions your strategy needs before naming jobs.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from your objectives and Theory of Change.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Mark each function in-house, shared or contracted.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Check who holds too many functions.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: club delivery in-house; mentoring shared with universities; audit contracted; fundraising takes 40% of the director’s time.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a function map showing how each is resourced.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
